=== 2026-06-08 Phase 3 global chunking addendum ===
Milestone: online TTT adaptation is now globally capped inside adapt_session_blocking.

Changes:
- Added MAX_ADAPT_CHUNK_TOKENS=128 in context_compressor.rs.
- adapt_session_blocking now internally slices every token stream into 128-token windows before calling forward_lm, so direct server compression calls, Codex/OpenAI compression, Anthropic compression, MCP compression, and search ingestion all inherit the same <512-token autograd/memory defense.
- search_ingest.rs now defines SEARCH_CHUNK from MAX_ADAPT_CHUNK_TOKENS.
- mcp_stdio.rs now defines ADAPT_WINDOW_TOKENS from MAX_ADAPT_CHUNK_TOKENS.
- extract_memory_vector_blocking now uses forward_last_logits for recall, avoiding a full [T, vocab] allocation when only the final token is needed.

Verification:
- context_compressor::tests::adapt_chunk_cap_stays_below_phase3_ceiling asserts MAX_ADAPT_CHUNK_TOKENS < 512.
